# Sidecar ignore (buildx honors <dockerfile>.dockerignore) — keeps the repo-root
# build context light. This runner COPYs crates/, server/, proxy/ and
# protocols/queen-kafka; the denylist below is what stops `docker build .` from
# tarring the multi-GB target/ dirs.
.git
.claude
server/target
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
benchmark-queen
webdoc
app
clients
examples
assets
helm
helm_queen
